{"id":878563,"title":"07｜AI智能体有哪些结合硬件的场景","content":"AI与硬件结合正迎来广泛应用，从智能玩具到生活助手，展现出巨大潜力。以AI手办为例，通过集成摄像头等硬件，这类设备能够执行复杂任务，如根据用户指令自动发送邮件。此外，AR技术的发展也促进了更多应用场景的出现，比如通过AR眼镜识别食材营养成分、规划健康饮食，或是基于个人体检报告提供用药建议。旅游方面，AI导游可根据游客偏好进行个性化解说，提升体验感。这些案例表明，AI与硬件融合不仅能简化日常生活中的诸多操作，还能在特定领域内实现智能化服务。未来，随着技术进步，预计会有更多创新产品和服务涌现，改变人们的生活方式。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400558,"user_name":"极客时间","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1239696,"ip_address":"天津","ucode":"95EF3B568CAB7B","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/ea/90/95b862bc.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748326076,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":1,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师情到深处，忽然提高音量，带耳机吓到我了","like_count":12,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":4051000,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/3d/d0/38/cb56cb3c.jpg","nickname":"xdcrazyboy","note":"","ucode":"7410EFEDC2A517","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":668948,"discussion_content":"那一下真的吓死人","content_length":8,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1753519007,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"上海","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}